<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Drink</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>drink &lt;drink container&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>drink obelisk
drink barrel
</pre>
<p>This is the way to drink liquid. You can buy various types of drink containers, 
which hold different amounts of liquid. It is vitally important that you drink, 
so you should always carry a drink container with you.
</p><p>When you grow thirsty you start getting messages: you are thirsty, then very 
thirsty, then dehydrated. Once you run dry you stop healing, and soon you start 
losing hit points instead; thirst hurts even more than hunger. In the end, you 
die.
</p><p>Water is free in a few places: the golden obelisk in the Market Square of 
Midgaard, the white fountain on Midgaard's palace square, and the water barrel 
in Mary's cabin in the forest of Haon-Dor.
</p><p>Note that drinks can be intoxicating, and that poisoning is possible.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
